<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―After about 15 minutes, we left the secret base behind.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "太古の暗い鳴動.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神ハンマー上げる.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\大魔女手ぶら.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\墓場夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
We were brought to a stretch of open ground called the graveyard clearing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Erika-chan</STYLE> were wearing Noh masks and ceremonial robes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a strange ritual in which <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> smashed a gravestone with a mace.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It happened when the ritual was over and <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> was about to leave the grave.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Congrats on becoming the witch!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> threw her arms around <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you know you're not supposed to talk to me until we get home."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ大魔女バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, I don't see why not. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">Something nasty happens every year, after all, so at least on the way back, let's all go home together."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Erika-chan</STYLE> took off her Noh mask as she said this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... All right."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱死神バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> took off her Noh mask too.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田森1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―We went back the same way, and along the way we heard about the incident of <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE>'s death.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The attempted-murder affair in Megasawa... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE>'s suicide and beheading... 
{PAUSE ""}
The curse-killings that happen every year.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\住民簿\呪殺ページ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Once we got home, they showed us the residents' register, and we were also told about the curse-killing cases that had been giving <STYLE ID="2">Erika-chan</STYLE> headaches for the past 9 years, and about the suicides of the elderly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She also confided that she had called us to the thirteenth-year memorial service to get hints from the Megasawa affair. [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\住民簿\桔梗.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"This person named </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ききょう">Kikyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">-san... she's the only one who didn't pass away in April..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd been working through possible hypotheses with everyone, but without seeing the whole picture, it was hard to reason anything out.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, what do you think? </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, you've been quiet this whole time..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱うつむき逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> had just been staring at the residents' register, but <STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE>'s question seemed to bring her back to herself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Let's see... This strays a little from the register, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">every time I come back home to Arata, it feels like the mood here has gotten worse."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"The mood?"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\和の廃墟.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... I mean, the culprit behind the curse-killing cases is somewhere in the settlement, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Everyone must distrust each other..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see: if your own neighbor might kill you, you can hardly be at peace.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, is that really how it is?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"I can't deny it. I tell everyone to stay fully on guard once April comes, but even so, this is how things are."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集集会所.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"In particular, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was made a suspect before anyone else. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So in April, from Shiyo 793 to 795, everyone took turns keeping watch over </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Keeping watch?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's right. To prove </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">his</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> innocence, he volunteered to stay at the meeting hall and have us watch </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">him</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">We really did watch </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> every April for 3 years, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s innocence was proven. In other words, the curse-killings kept happening."</STYLE><PG>
In that case, taking it a step further, it's even possible that everyone is the culprit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, that doesn't add up either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then they could just kill everyone at once instead of taking so much time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means there's a point to killing one person each year...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Silence hung in the air for a while, but
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Can I say something? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　I feel bad saying this in front of people who live in Arata, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">the culprit isn't necessarily just one person, and it's possible everyone's the culprit, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Of course. Even </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and I are suspects. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, who's away in Tokyo, can probably be ruled out. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The curse-killings happened even when she didn't come home in April..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"But... sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">. I don't want you to take this the wrong way, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">if you secretly came back to Arata just for the day of each incident..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, even if she made the round trip from Tokyo in one day, killing someone without anyone noticing and heading right back is a bit of a stretch. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Besides, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> has her part-time job or a mix... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">I mean, she lives a life where she's always around other people. She's sure to have an alibi too."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... That's right. It'd be a little hard for me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I don't have a driver's license, and the train is the only way I can get around. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If I were the culprit, I wouldn't want to do something as easy to trace as staying overnight..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, at least, is very likely ruled out as the culprit...<PG>
To begin with, the first curse-killing happened when <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> was 11. It's a stretch to call that a child's doing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By the same reasoning, <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> is ruled out too.<PG>
But <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> can do those parkour-like moves just like <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>, can't she?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that kind of athletic ability, wouldn't the crimes be possible?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> is 10 now, so <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, who was 11 back then, could have done it too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But deciding someone's the culprit just because they can move like that is wrong after all...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Argh, just thinking about it gives me a headache..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
As she said this, <STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE> flopped down on the tatami.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Next to her, <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> was breathing softly in her sleep.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, at least take a bath."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Zzz... zzz..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> didn't react; she was sound asleep.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> racked his brains over all sorts of things too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Most of what we've talked about just now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> arrived at too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But no matter what, we can't get to the truth..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Um... why doesn't everyone just run away from Arata in the first place? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　If things like this were happening, I'd be too scared..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I wouldn't blame anyone for running away from here... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">but no one does. Leaving here is as good as leaving the ones who stay to die. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">One for all, all for one. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That's rooted deep, so even with the distrust between them, everyone holds on, even while they're </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="おび">afraid</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Shouldn't you... report it to the police after all..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Maybe so... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I don't want to turn anyone from Arata over to the police, though... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Besides, there are people opposed to calling the police. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Plenty of them truly believe it's a curse, so if we did something like that, they say we'd provoke its </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="たた">retribution</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and everyone would be curse-killed. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Once tomorrow's memorial service is over, maybe I'll go talk to the police..."</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "116" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
If it's a person's doing, they must know the psychology of the people of the Arata settlement inside out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・Making them believe it's a curse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・Keeping them in Arata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・Not reporting it to the police.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
These elements are what make the curse-killing cases work.<PG>
But what on earth is the goal beyond that?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since the suicides stopped, someone is carrying on where they left off, by human hands?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Does people dying mean something in itself?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is there a reason people have to die in April?<PG>
To begin with, even if the 9 years of curse-killings are a clever trick by human hands, there's still the rash of suicides that went on for decades before that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If anything, that's far more mysterious.<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"The people who committed suicide were 75 or older, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Has anyone turned 75 since the last suicide happened?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, since then the oldest person has been me. I'm 71, but since the last suicide, there's been no one older than me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So that doesn't mean the suicides are over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the suicides up to now didn't happen every year to begin with.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, wait a minute.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's something fundamentally baffling here.<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">. If you knew they'd commit suicide, why didn't you stop the people 75 and older? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　When people 75 and older reach April, you could prevent the suicides, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes, what's baffling is that for 50 years, no one prevented the suicides.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
If you know someone's going to kill themselves in April, I'd think stopping them would be easy...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see... Indeed, it's just as </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> says. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But that's... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">because I gave the order, and had no one stop anyone from killing themselves."</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\bgm_semarikuru.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Why!? </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">... you knew and didn't stop them!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You may think I'm dodging responsibility when I say this... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">but it's what I was told by the previous Grand Witch-sama when I took over as Grand Witch... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That anyone who tries to take their own life must never, ever be stopped..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Why!? For what reason...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I was told to keep this only in my own heart... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">but there's no point hiding it anymore, now that it's come to this. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what I'm about to say must never be spoken of to anyone in the settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Understood?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... All right."</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="12">"Understood."</STYLE><PG>
The fact <STYLE ID="2">Erika-chan</STYLE> had kept hidden all this time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A truth she'd been told never to speak of.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We leaned forward and kept waiting for the moment <STYLE ID="2">Erika-chan</STYLE> would begin to speak.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"People who would try to stop a suicide... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">apparently there never were any, even before I came here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Those who kill themselves have reason enough, so no one stops them..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
............?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
The previous Grand Witch-sama went out of her way to make a reason like that strictly secret...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What on earth is the 'reason enough' of those who kill themselves...<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"'Reason enough'...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Apparently it happened just once... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\ホラーサウンド.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">Not long after Kikyo-san died―a curse-killing, inside the settlement..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A curse-killing after Kikyo-san died!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So a murder case happened in the settlement!?<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Why... why would something like that happen!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That much they didn't tell me. Only that the ones who were curse-killed were Kikyo-san's family, apparently. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That's as far as I was told..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Wait just a second!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had <STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE>, who had been silent for a while, finally noticed something?<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"So doesn't that mean that because Kikyo-san didn't die in April, she was seen as an 'outsider,' not one of Arata's people!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Meaning the insular, deeply wary people of the Arata settlement killed Kikyo-san's family, since they were seen as not belonging to the settlement..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Indeed, that possibility can't be ruled out. In fact, the register entries of the people killed back then have all been erased. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Not dying in April must have been something threatening to the Arata settlement..."</STYLE><PG>
Because Kikyo-san died in February, she wasn't accepted as one of Arata's people.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So her family wasn't accepted as Arata's people either, and they were curse-killed by the wary residents of that time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see... Dying in April is the proof that you're a person of the Arata settlement.<PG>
If they say so clearly that 'there was a curse-killing,' then the people before Kikyo-san weren't killed in April; they really did die naturally in April.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="5">"But this makes it clear. Why the suicides happened so often."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE> went on, sounding confident.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"The people who killed themselves probably knew why Kikyo-san hadn't died in April. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">So, what if they themselves didn't meet the conditions for dying in April... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Don't you think the people who killed themselves took their own lives with that thought in mind?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"What do you mean? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Ah... I get it! If they didn't die in April, their families would be curse-killed...!"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Erica.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Exactly. The people who killed themselves probably did it to protect their families. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">And once they were past 75, an age when they could die suddenly at any time..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Kikyo-san's family was buried as 'outsiders' and erased from the register too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If you didn't die in April, your family would be killed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The people back then must have been anxious.<PG>
Those who realized they wouldn't die in April killed themselves.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All to protect their own families...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Genius girl indeed... I agree with </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Erina-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s idea. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Maybe I was avoiding thinking about it without even realizing it myself... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Thinking about why the previous Grand Witch-sama didn't tell me would, in itself, be breaking my promise to the Grand Witch-sama... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Well, I've gone and broken every promise right here anyway..."</STYLE><PG>
Thinking itself is a sin.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The previous Grand Witch-sama had something she wanted to keep hidden that badly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something she wanted to keep hidden...<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"So the curse-killing cases of these 10 years and the suicides are completely unrelated. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">The culprit just played along with Arata's peculiar way of things, where people die in April. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">That alone makes you want to tie the suicides and the curse-killing cases together no matter what. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">The culprit only used a clever psychological trick. It's just misdirection!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see... We spent a lot of effort looking into how the suicides and the curse-killings were connected. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So that was the culprit's smokescreen, was it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now the top priority is stopping any more curse-killings.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From here on, it looks like I need to put the suicides out of my mind.<PG>
But... 
{PAUSE ""}
what is this feeling that something's off...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Are the curse-killing cases of these 9 years and the suicides really unrelated?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To begin with, there's no guarantee this register was kept perfectly, and the reason for the suicides is just something we came up with here, right now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If it were me, I'd think about secretly running away from the settlement or something.
